From: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: add Anbernic H700 handheld family

Add the consolidated Anbernic H700 handheld device-tree family and shared hardware topology used by the nuubOS universal H700 image.

Signed-off-by: nuubOS Project <noreply@nuubos.invalid>
---
